    "title": "Lake County Theatre Company Presents HolidAIs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charise Reynolds ,\n8 hours ago A few weeks ago, I witnessed a rather passionate argument between a middle schooler and a grandparent about the use of A.I. (artificial intelligence) in the movie industry. The middle schooler, who is also an actor, was completely against it and made a compelling argument. It’s a nuanced topic for sure. And as such, it’s not going to be easily resolved anytime soon. In the meantime, the Lake County Theatre Company has chosen to collaborate with A.I. to create an “unforgettable holiday experience” that they are calling Lake County Theatre Presents: HolidAIs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
